<section class="framework-section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-left">
        <h2 class="section-title">The Discipline of Discovery</h2>
        <p class="font-secondary intro-text">
          Small and mid-cap businesses can offer significant opportunities for investors willing to look beyond the consensus. Our approach is built on rigorous, bottom-up research designed to uncover emerging businesses with the potential to compound earnings well ahead of market expectations.
        </p>
        <p class="font-secondary intro-text" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          Differentiated outcomes come from insight, patience, and disciplined conviction.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-right">
        <div class="architecture-list">
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">01</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>Under-Researched Advantage</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Target inefficiencies in smaller companies that receive limited analyst and institutional coverage - where information asymmetry creates mispricing and early entry opportunities.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">02</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>High-Conviction Allocation</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Build a portfolio where individual stock selection is a meaningful driver of returns, while maintaining prudent diversification to manage the inherent volatility of the small and mid-cap universe.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">03</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>Sector-Agnostic Approach</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Opportunity is not confined to a single sector or theme. The strategy actively search across industries for businesses with compelling fundamentals, structural growth potential, and attractive risk-reward characteristics. Sector exposure is driven by opportunity and not predetermined constraints.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">04</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>Long-Term Lens</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Invest with a multi-year horizon, allowing businesses time to execute, scale, and compound. The focus is on participating in the full evolution of an investment thesis rather than reacting to short-term market movements.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .framework-section {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  
  .row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6rem;
    
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
  
  .col-left {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 450px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      max-width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      top: 0;
    }
  }
  
  .col-right {
    flex: 1.5;
  }
  
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #000000;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .architecture-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  
  .architecture-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    
    &:first-child {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    
    &:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 576px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }
  }
  
  .item-number {
    font-size: 2rem !important;
    font-weight: 300 !important;
    color: #75b0e2 !important;
    margin-top: -0.2rem;
  }
  
  .item-content {
    h4 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #001b3a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #666;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
